<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Trading Lessons - DRABZ</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #06110d;
            color: white;
        }

        header {
            background: #071a12;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #00ff88;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #00ff88;
            margin: 0;
        }

        main {
            padding: 25px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .lesson {
            background: #0b1d15;
            border: 1px solid #123c29;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .lesson h2 {
            color: #00ff88;
        }

        .lesson p {
            color: #cccccc;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }


.lesson-link {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
}

.lesson-link .lesson {
    cursor: pointer;
}

.lesson-link:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
}
        .back {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #00ff88;
            text-decoration: none;
        }


.start-lesson {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    background: #19e875;
    color: #0b1812;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 100;
}

.start-lesson:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
}
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>DRABZ</h1>
    <p>Trading Education Platform</p>
</header>

<main>

    <a href="/dashboard" class="back">← Back to Dashboard</a>

<div class="lesson">
    <h2>📚 Lesson 1: Introduction to Forex</h2>

    <p>
        Learn what Forex is, how the currency market works,
        and the basic concepts every new trader should understand.
    </p>

    <a href="/lesson/1" class="start-lesson">
        Start Lesson →
    </a>
</div>    

<a href="/lesson/2" class="lesson">
    <h2>📈 Lesson 2: Market Structure</h2>
    <p>
        Learn about higher highs, higher lows, lower highs,
        lower lows, trends, and market direction.
    </p>
</a>


    <div class="lesson">
        <h2>📦 Lesson 5: Supply and Demand</h2>
        <p>
            Learn the basic idea of supply and demand zones and
            how they can be studied as part of price analysis.
        </p>
    </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
